{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101633","id":2281396487,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6H-1kH","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101633","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101633.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101633.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101633","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101633/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101633/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101633/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4842dc5a819cefc234431f8cb020ef8487104647","number":101633,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add external force property to `SpringBoneSimulator3D`","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Follow up https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101409\r\n\r\nThere are properties in godot-vrm for overriding for all joint settings (https://github.com/V-Sekai/godot-vrm/blob/master/addons/vrm/vrm_secondary.gd), but it should be carefully discussed whether they are really necessary or not, since there are alternatives that can be applied by for-loop for each joint.\r\n\r\nHowever, only this external force (add_force in godot-vrm) is obvious difficult to replace by other APIs. UniVRM has an API for that as well: https://github.com/vrm-c/UniVRM/blob/master/Assets/VRM/Runtime/SpringBone/VRMSpringBone.cs#L100\r\n\r\nIt is like changing the gravity of each joint, but this force may change frequently and dynamically, unlike setting. So I decide that this property is worth adding.\r\n\r\nMaybe we could also add a randomizer to set random force for each joint (like fractal field) but we should do that in another PR or proposal as a follow up, since we need to be careful how we define the parameters.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"close